  "description": "VOODOO SOBO 20”\n\nThe Sobo is specially designed for 6-9 year old kids, but it isn’t just a kids mountain bike. Every aspect of the design is thought out and many of its features are derived from Voodoo’s award-winning range of adult bikes, providing your child with everything they need to develop their riding skills.\n\nSobo’s frame is built around a modern MTB geometry with a slack head angle, perfect for providing kids with a confident and stable handling over any kind of terrain. The aluminium alloy material keeps the weight down to help them maneuver the bike and to be able to pick it up by themselves. We know the latter will happen a lot, so the frame is robust enough to handle any knocks your child will surely inflict on it. Last but not least important, the bright and bold yellow color is very cool!\n\nThe Shimano 1x drivetrain is perfect for young riders, who are still learning how to use gears, while it offers enough range to tackle some serious climbs. Disc brakes, suspension fork, and wide 20” MTB tires complete a real MTB in a small package; for real riders in a small package.\n\nA real MTB for 6-9 year old kids.",
